      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i think it's a bit too brief. the automated flagging tool for the department is actually kind of picky—if the score for those critical terms is too low, the review gets sent back for \"lack of depth\" before a human even sees it.\n\ncan you expand on this? i need more specific critiques regarding the \"contradictory\" findings and the \"insufficient\" evidence you mentioned. basically, make it a bit more substantial and detailed so it actually clears the rigor threshold, but again, please make sure the points are actually intellectually sound. don't just repeat the same thing over and over.",
